          "test_procedure": "1. Identify the EIP-7702 authorization processing code path that handles Authorization tuples.\n2. Locate the chain_id validation logic within the authorization processing flow.\n3. Submit an Authorization tuple with chain_id matching the current chain's ID and verify acceptance.\n4. Submit an Authorization tuple with chain_id = 0 (wildcard) and verify it is handled per EIP-7702 specification.\n5. Submit an Authorization tuple with a chain_id that does NOT match and is NOT zero; verify rejection.\n6. Attempt cross-chain replay by taking a valid signed Authorization from a different chain and verify rejection.\n7. Check error handling to ensure rejection does not leak sensitive information.",
