            "notes": "Attacker can replay an Authorization signed for one chain on a different chain if chain_id validation is missing."
          },
          "test_procedure": "1. Review the EIP-7702 Authorizer actor implementation for chain_id handling during authorization creation.\n2. Verify that the authorization signature message includes the chain_id as part of the signed data.\n3. Attempt to create an authorization with chain_id = 0 and verify documentation warns about cross-chain replayability.\n4. Test that authorizations signed with explicit chain_id cannot be modified post-signature.\n5. Verify the signing flow prevents user confusion between chain_id = 0 (wildcard) and specific chain IDs.",
